From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: OddBlueDog <3959851+OddBlueDog@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Sun, 18 Oct 2026 21:22:42 +0100
Subject: [PATCH] wifi: mt76: mt7915: only decode HE radiotap fields from a
 C-RXV

On chips other than mt7915 the rx mode is taken from the P-RXV, so the
HE radiotap decoder also ran for frames without RXD group 5 and read
its fields from the P-RXV and the frame contents instead. Group 5 is
only enabled while a monitor interface exists; require it.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
---
 mt7915/mac.c | 6 +++++-
 1 file changed, 5 insertions(+), 1 deletion(-)

diff --git a/mt7915/mac.c b/mt7915/mac.c
index 8489f015..7c8422bd 100644
--- a/mt7915/mac.c
+++ b/mt7915/mac.c
@@ -529,7 +529,11 @@ mt7915_mac_fill_rx(struct mt7915_dev *dev, struct sk_buff *skb,
 				     *info);
 	}
 
-	if (rxv && mode >= MT_PHY_TYPE_HE_SU && !(status->flag & RX_FLAG_8023))
+	/* the HE radiotap fields come from the C-RXV (group 5), which is
+	 * only enabled while a monitor interface is up
+	 */
+	if (rxv && (rxd1 & MT_RXD1_NORMAL_GROUP_5) &&
+	    mode >= MT_PHY_TYPE_HE_SU && !(status->flag & RX_FLAG_8023))
 		mt76_connac2_mac_decode_he_radiotap(&dev->mt76, skb, rxv, mode);
 
 	if (!status->wcid || !ieee80211_is_data_qos(fc))
